</p>
<blockquote><pre>
+1 &le; u &lt; +&infin;
</pre></blockquote>
<p>
If the function is called with u &lt; 1, an error occurs.
The function cosh(u) has two inverse functions (the curve
looks similar to a sqrt(..) function). acosh(..) returns
